<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_58f849907b52e99bd23af800f8d763a8229c9f259761916e6f9cd2caf9fafd1d_n0044/tu_0006> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "6. In patients with HCM and 1 or more of the following risk factors, an ICD is reasonable if meaningful survival of greater than 1 year is expected: a. Maximum LV wall thickness ≥30 mm (LOE: B-NR) (S7.4-2,S7.4-3,S7.4-23,S7.4-24). b. SCD in 1 or more first-degree relatives presumably caused by HCM (LOE: C-LD) (S7.4-25,S7.4-26). c. 1 or more episodes of unexplained syncope within the preceding 6 months (LOE: C-LD) (S7.4-8,S7.4-26)." .
